#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: params bio
#: content/authors/mirko-zamora/_index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An Argentine illustrator and concept artist who explores fantasy and science fiction through character design, architecture, and narrative."
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/authors/mirko-zamora/_index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirko E. Zamora"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/authors/mirko-zamora/_index.en.md
msgid ""
"I am an Argentine illustrator and concept artist, largely self-taught. My "
"journey began searching for answers I couldn't find in traditional "
"education: a way to build worlds, characters, and environments capable of "
"telling stories with a strong identity."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/authors/mirko-zamora/_index.en.md
msgid ""
"Over the years, I have collaborated with psychoanalysis journals, "
"independent authors, companies, and my own narrative projects, developing a "
"practice that combines research, design, and visual storytelling."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/authors/mirko-zamora/_index.en.md
msgid ""
"Today, thanks to Story Seed Library, I am putting onto paper years of "
"imagining possible futures for the Argentine landscape: architecture, "
"communities, and ecosystems where technology develops in harmony with "
"natural cycles, guided by respect and responsibility. Solar Punk Criollo was "
"born from this collaboration and the shared desire to help imagine a better "
"future for our civilization."
msgstr ""

